  "scenes": [
    {
      "text": "What if Light had to explain every name to L before the notebook worked? Mandatory peer review.",
      "label": "JUSTICE NEEDS A SOURCE",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.449169228522031,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-light",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Light planning and reacting; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This rule pauses entries. Light gives a reason. L can challenge it. Terrible news for arrogance.",
      "label": "A DIFFERENT NOTEBOOK RULE",
      "start": 4.449169228522031,
      "end": 9.22472538886614,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-book",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Notebook context, not graphic harm; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-book",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Notebook context, not graphic harm; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Light says someone looks guilty. My guy, cheekbone analysis isn't a criminal justice system.",
      "label": "THE FIRST EXCUSE",
      "start": 9.22472538886614,
      "end": 13.570825059970671,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-light",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Light planning and reacting; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then he cites online agreement. L asks for the original report. The god complex needs a bibliography.",
      "label": "THE FOLLOW UP QUESTION",
      "start": 13.570825059970671,
      "end": 18.87890726697186,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-l",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "L examining a deduction; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-l",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "L examining a deduction; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ryuk watches humans recreate a terrible university group project. Somebody pass the apples.",
      "label": "RYUK BOUGHT FRONT ROW SEATS",
      "start": 18.87890726697186,
      "end": 23.620106908176805,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-ryuk",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Ryuk observing human behavior; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Light tries a longer speech. Dramatic breathing doesn't make guesses facts. Incredible discovery.",
      "label": "CONFIDENCE IS NOT PROOF",
      "start": 23.620106908176805,
      "end": 28.309771770673,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-light",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Light planning and reacting; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "L compares the explanations. Why does criticism suddenly count as guilt? Why is evidence optional?",
      "label": "FOLLOW THE CONTRADICTION",
      "start": 28.309771770673,
      "end": 33.377358343700024,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-l",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "L examining a deduction; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-l",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "L examining a deduction; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Light's justice bends around his ego. Very convenient weather system. Bro appointed himself the whole forecast.",
      "label": "THE MASK STARTS SLIPPING",
      "start": 33.377358343700024,
      "end": 38.788510108118714,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-light",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Light planning and reacting; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "L isn't automatically correct either. Both geniuses can miss evidence. The notebook doesn't delete uncertainty.",
      "label": "THE REAL CHANGE",
      "start": 38.788510108118714,
      "end": 44.23401839167656,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-book",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Notebook context, not graphic harm; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-book",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Notebook context, not graphic harm; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Their duel becomes defending conclusions instead of delivering smug indoor monologues with stationery.",
      "label": "A DIFFERENT KIND OF DUEL",
      "start": 44.23401839167656,
      "end": 49.19853540728609,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-l",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "L examining a deduction; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-l",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "L examining a deduction; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ryuk asks when they'll finish. L requests supporting documents. Supernatural horror has become an academic hearing.",
      "label": "EVEN THE SHINIGAMI IS TIRED",
      "start": 49.19853540728609,
      "end": 54.7814697674006,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-ryuk",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Ryuk observing human behavior; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Light wanted unquestioned authority. His final boss is somebody calmly asking for evidence. Source, bro. Show the source.",
      "label": "THE FINAL BOSS IS CITATIONS",
      "start": 54.7814697674006,
      "end": 61.0,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-light-explains-every-name-01-light",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Light planning and reacting; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
